### 헬스체크
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### 판매 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sales
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseId": "course-1",
  "studentId": "student-99",
  "amount": 50000,
  "paidAt": "2025-04-01T10:00:00+09:00"
}

### 취소 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sales/{{saleId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refundAmount": 50000,
  "cancelledAt": "2025-04-03T10:00:00+09:00"
}

### 판매 내역 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/sales?creatorId=creator-1&from=2025-03-01T00:00:00+09:00&to=2025-04-01T00:00:00+09:00

### 월별 정산 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/settlements/monthly?creatorId=creator-1&yearMonth=2025-03

### 정산 확정
POST http://localhost:8080/api/settlements/confirm?creatorId=creator-1&yearMonth=2025-03

### 정산 지급
POST http://localhost:8080/api/settlements/pay?creatorId=creator-1&yearMonth=2025-03

### 운영자 집계
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/settlements?from=2025-01-01&to=2025-03-31

### CSV 다운로드
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/settlements/export?from=2025-01-01&to=2025-03-31

### 수수료 정책 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/fee-policies

### 수수료 정책 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/fee-policies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "feeRate": 0.15,
  "effectiveFrom": "2026-01-01"
}
